{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 40, "data": [{"docid2": 2313568, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202609/t20260903_2313568.htm", "content": "　　9月2日，全市安全生产暨隐患大排查大整治攻坚任务推进会召开。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰出席并讲话。市领导杨国昕、李盛烨、张元明、廖金辉、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于安全生产", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202609/t20260903_2313568.htm", "docreltime": "2026.09.03 09:17:00", "doctitle": "全市安全生产暨隐患大排查大整治攻坚任务推进会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2528566, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202609/t20260903_2313568.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202609/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2248978, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260717_2248978.htm", "content": "　　7月16日，在收听收看全省安全生产隐患大排查大整治工作部署推进会后，市委、市政府随即召开视频会议，对全市安全生产工作进行再安排、再部署、再推进。市委书记李春出席会议并讲话，市长陈岳峰主持。市领导杨国昕", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260717_2248978.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.17 11:33:00", "doctitle": "全市安全生产隐患大排查大整治工作部署推进会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2462493, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260717_2248978.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2238788, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260711_2238788.htm", "content": "　　7月10日，根据省委、省政府工作部署，省委常委崔永辉、省政协副主席黄如欣分别带队赴三明市防汛抗旱指挥部、沙县区防汛抗旱指挥部，会商研判台风“巴威”发展趋势及影响，督导检查我市防汛防台风工作。副市长吴健", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260711_2238788.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.11 09:11:00", "doctitle": "省领导来明督导检查防御台风工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2452105, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260711_2238788.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2233194, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260701_2233194.htm", "content": "　　6月30日，三明市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组第三次会议召开。市委书记、市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组组长李春出席并讲话。市长、领导小组第一副组长陈岳峰主持。市领导黄冠华、杨国昕、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260701_2233194.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.01 09:03:00", "doctitle": "三明市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组第三次会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2446103, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260701_2233194.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2214096, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260605_2214096.htm", "content": "　　6月4日，市政府与省水利投资开发集团工作座谈会召开。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰，省水投集团党委书记、董事长梅长河出席会议并讲话。省水投集团党委委员、副总经理杨本南，副市长吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰对梅长河一", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260605_2214096.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.05 08:37:00", "doctitle": "市政府与省水利投资开发集团召开座谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2426106, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260605_2214096.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2209407, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260527_2209407.htm", "content": "　　5月26日，市委书记李春、市长陈岳峰调研市属国有企业重点项目工作。市领导郭海阳、吴健成参加。\n　　李春一行深入市城发集团三明康养中心、市交发集团高技能人才和安全智能教育培训中心、福建一建集团市中西医结", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260527_2209407.htm", "docreltime": "2026.05.27 09:41:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研市属国有企业重点项目工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2420996, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260527_2209407.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2195361, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260319_2195361.htm", "content": "　　3月18日，三明市2026年上半年新兵入伍欢送仪式在三明医科学院举行。市长、市征兵领导小组组长陈岳峰出席仪式并讲话。市征兵领导小组领导杨刚、吴健成，三明医科学院领导张松富、向红亮参加。\n　　陈岳峰代表市委", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260319_2195361.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.19 08:53:00", "doctitle": "我市举行今年上半年新兵入伍欢送仪式", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2404854, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260319_2195361.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2190882, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260223_2190882.htm", "content": "\n　　2月21日，我市举行2026年新春茶话会，邀请明籍乡贤、企业家、驻外商会代表欢聚一堂，共叙乡情、共谋发展。李腾、廖世铢、游祥飞、谢晓谊、李全荣、厉云、余润德等领导嘉宾，市委书记李春、市长陈岳峰、副市长吴", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260223_2190882.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.23 09:44:00", "doctitle": "我市举行2026年新春茶话会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2399500, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260223_2190882.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2177737, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251219_2177737.htm", "content": "\n　　12月18日，全市加快养老服务高质量发展推进会召开，动员全市上下进一步统一思想、凝聚共识，推动养老服务高质量发展。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰，省民政厅副厅长王文才出席会议并讲话。市领导胡帅、吴健成分别参加", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251219_2177737.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.19 09:18:00", "doctitle": "全市加快养老服务高质量发展推进会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2383922, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251219_2177737.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2175099, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251208_2175099.htm", "content": "\n　　12月7日晚，第二十九届沙县小吃旅游文化节暨第三届海峡两岸美食嘉年华在沙县区开幕。\n　　海峡两岸关系协会副会长仇开明出席活动并致辞。省政协副主席阮诗玮宣布开幕。台湾海基会前董事长林中森、中国科学院院士", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251208_2175099.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.08 08:47:00", "doctitle": "第二十九届沙县小吃旅游文化节暨第三届海峡两岸美食嘉年华开幕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2380692, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251208_2175099.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "cb788408-2ddb-4550-857a-0079144fcdec.jpg", "appdocid": 2175099, "appfile": "W020251208317860254015.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/t20251208_2175099.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202512/W020251208/W020251208317860254015.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/W020251208317860254015.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202512/W020251208317860254015.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2165652, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251031_2165652.htm", "content": "\n　　10月30日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会，研究部署“两重”“两新”和“十四五”规划收官工作。市领导杨国昕、胡帅、钟科、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻党的二十届四中全会精神", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251031_2165652.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.31 08:47:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议——推进“两重”“两新”工作和“十四五”规划收官", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2369310, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251031_2165652.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2164888, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251029_2164888.htm", "content": "\n　　10月28日，在重阳节来临之际，市委书记李春赴三元区看望慰问高龄老人代表。市领导郭海阳、吴健成参加。\n　　李春一行来到百岁老人刘彦琛、李景先家中，与老人亲切交谈，向他们致以重阳节的诚挚问候和美好祝福，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251029_2164888.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.29 08:23:00", "doctitle": "市领导开展重阳节看望慰问活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2368442, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251029_2164888.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2153345, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250909_2153345.htm", "content": "\n　　白露时节，丹桂飘香，美丽鹭岛高朋满座。9月8日，第二十五届中国国际投资贸易洽谈会（下称“投洽会”）在厦门开幕。市委书记李春，市领导杨国昕、郭海阳、周庆裕、吴健成参加投洽会相关活动。\n　　本届投洽会以", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250909_2153345.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.09 08:48:00", "doctitle": "我市组团参加第二十五届中国国际投资贸易洽谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2355030, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250909_2153345.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2152917, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250908_2152917.htm", "content": "\n　　9月7日，三明市特色产业链招商推介会在厦门举行。市委书记李春出席活动并致辞。市领导杨国昕、郭海阳、周庆裕、吴健成参加。\n　　李春代表市委、市政府向各位来宾表示热烈欢迎，对长期以来关心支持三明经济社会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250908_2152917.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.08 08:54:00", "doctitle": "三明市特色产业链招商推介会在厦门举行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2354610, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250908_2152917.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "cecdcfe7-0e6d-450b-a1f8-9e2a88aa1dd8.jpg", "appdocid": 2152917, "appfile": "W020250908323510869584.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250908_2152917.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202509/W020250908/W020250908323510869584.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/W020250908323510869584.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/W020250908323510869584.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2150460, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250829_2150460.htm", "content": "\n　　今年是中国人民抗日战争暨世界反法西斯战争胜利80周年。近日，市委书记李春、市长陈岳峰分别看望慰问在明的抗战老战士代表，向他们颁发“中国人民抗日战争胜利80周年”纪念章，并致以崇高敬意和诚挚问候。市领导", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250829_2150460.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.29 08:53:00", "doctitle": "市领导看望慰问抗战老战士代表并颁发纪念章", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2351639, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250829_2150460.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2146063, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250813_2146063.htm", "content": "\n　　8月12日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开全市持续优化营商环境专题会议，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于优化营商环境的重要论述，部署推动营商环境持续优化。市领导杨国昕、张元明、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰充分", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250813_2146063.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.13 08:33:00", "doctitle": "全市持续优化营商环境专题会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2347108, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250813_2146063.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2143602, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250802_2143602.htm", "content": "\n　　8月1日，受市委书记李春委托，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰前往市军休所，看望慰问军队离退休干部，并进行座谈。市领导杨兴忠、吴健成，军分区领导陈永团参加。\n　　陈岳峰代表市委、市政府向军队离退休干部致以节日", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250802_2143602.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.02 16:32:00", "doctitle": "市领导走访慰问军队离退休干部", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2347109, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250802_2143602.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2136109, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/t20250703_2136109.htm", "content": "\n　　7月2日，市委书记李春、市长陈岳峰会见省工控集团党委书记、董事长杨方一行，就深化对接合作进行座谈交流。省工控集团领导黄金镖、郑剑军、黄予、何天仁，市领导郭海阳、吴健成参加。\n　　李春对杨方一行的到来", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/t20250703_2136109.htm", "docreltime": "2025.07.03 09:12:00", "doctitle": "市领导会见省工控集团董事长杨方一行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2347110, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/t20250703_2136109.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202507/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2130086, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250611_2130086.htm", "content": "\n　　6月10日，市委书记、市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组组长李春主持召开领导小组第二次会议，贯彻落实党中央决策部署和省委工作要求，全力推动新时代民营经济强省战略在三明落地落实。市领导黄冠华、杨", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250611_2130086.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.11 08:47:00", "doctitle": "三明市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组第二次会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327636, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250611_2130086.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2129066, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250606_2129066.htm", "content": "\n　　6月5日，我市开展“2025年三明市防暴雨Ⅱ级应急响应暨三元区城区防洪水Ⅱ级应急响应演练”。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰现场观摩并作点评讲话，副市长吴健成担任演练总指挥。\n　　本次演练模拟全市遭遇强降雨、三大", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250606_2129066.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.06 08:37:00", "doctitle": "我市开展防汛应急响应演练", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2326303, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250606_2129066.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2127453, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250530_2127453.htm", "content": "\n　　5月29日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开全市经济分析会议，贯彻落实省委、省政府工作部署，分析研判经济形势，研究部署下阶段工作。市领导胡帅、张元明、林菁、廖金辉、柳建忠、钟科、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250530_2127453.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.30 09:44:00", "doctitle": "全市经济分析会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2324327, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250530_2127453.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2126637, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250529_2126637.htm", "content": "\n　　5月28日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰赴市防汛抗旱指挥部，会商研判近期防汛防暴雨形势，视频连线各县（市、区），调度部署下阶段防范应对措施。副市长吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250529_2126637.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.29 08:34:00", "doctitle": "市领导会商部署防汛防暴雨工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2323412, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250529_2126637.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2119114, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250427_2119114.htm", "content": "\n　　4月25日，三明市政府与上海国有资本投资公司在上海签订合作协议。副市长吴健成、上海国投公司副总裁许业荣参加签约仪式。\n　　双方围绕基金群合作、构建高质量发展的现代产业体系和投资生态体系、党建人才合作等", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250427_2119114.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.27 08:49:00", "doctitle": "市政府与上海国有资本投资公司在上海签订合作协议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2314779, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250427_2119114.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2116116, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250418_2116116.htm", "content": "\n　　4月16日，我市与中铁十八局集团举行深化战略合作签约仪式，分别签订中铁建竹基零碳科技产业园、竹林资源规模开发与高效利用合作协议。中铁十八局集团党委委员、副总经理尹黔，市委常委、副市长胡帅，副市长吴健", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250418_2116116.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.18 08:29:00", "doctitle": "我市与中铁十八局集团举行深化战略合作签约仪式", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2311646, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250418_2116116.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2114349, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250410_2114349.htm", "content": "\n　　4月9日，全市防汛抗旱工作视频会议召开，传达全国全省会议精神，分析研判今年我市防汛抗旱形势，布置下一步工作。市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕出席并讲话，副市长吴健成主持会议。\n　　会议要求，全市各级各有关", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250410_2114349.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.10 09:49:00", "doctitle": "全市防汛抗旱工作视频会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2309481, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250410_2114349.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2112597, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250402_2112597.htm", "content": "\n　　4月1日，全市消防安全、安全生产工作暨市政府第二季度防范重特大生产安全事故视频会议召开，分析研判当前形势，安排部署下阶段工作。市长陈岳峰出席会议并讲话。市领导杨国昕、林菁、廖金辉、柳建忠、钟科、吴健", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250402_2112597.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.02 08:35:00", "doctitle": "全市消防安全、安全生产工作暨市政府第二季度防范重特大生产安全事故视频会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2307419, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250402_2112597.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2109375, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250325_2109375.htm", "content": "\n　　3月24日，全市退役军人工作会议召开，深入贯彻落实习近平总书记关于退役军人工作的重要论述，推动全市退役军人工作高质量发展。市委书记李春出席会议并讲话，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持。市领导杨兴忠、郑隆松", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250325_2109375.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.25 09:06:00", "doctitle": "全市退役军人工作会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2303796, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250325_2109375.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2108542, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250321_2108542.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰会见了省邮政管理局党组书记、局长王文胜和各快递企业省域负责人一行，双方就进一步深化合作进行深入交流。副市长吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰对王文胜一行的到来表示欢迎，向省邮政管", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250321_2108542.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.21 08:44:00", "doctitle": "市领导会见省邮政管理局局长王文胜一行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2302760, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250321_2108542.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2108537, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250321_2108537.htm", "content": "\n　　3月19日至20日，三明市委常委、统战部部长黄冠华，市政府副市长吴健成带队赴南安市开展泉明山海协作产业链、供应链（南安专场）对接活动，南安市委主要领导出席并致辞。\n　　会议指出，按照省委、省政府实施新时", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250321_2108537.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.21 08:40:00", "doctitle": "泉明山海协作产业链、供应链（南安专场）对接活动举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2302747, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250321_2108537.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2107965, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250319_2107965.htm", "content": "\n　　热血青年踏征程，强军报国正当时。3月17日上午，三明市2025年上半年新兵入伍欢送仪式在三明医学科技职业学院举行。副市长吴健成主持欢送仪式，三明军分区领导沈彩平、陈永团参加。\n　　陈永团在欢送仪式上致辞，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250319_2107965.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.19 08:45:00", "doctitle": "我市举行2025年上半年新兵入伍欢送仪式", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2302079, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250319_2107965.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2105590, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250308_2105590.htm", "content": "\n　　3月7日，全市深入拓展“委员河长”工作会议召开，贯彻落实市委政协工作会议精神，总结交流去年工作情况，研究部署下阶段工作。市政协主席宋志强，省政协人口资源环境委员会副主任郑李亭，省水利厅二级巡视员谢敏", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250308_2105590.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.08 17:05:00", "doctitle": "全市深入拓展“委员河长”工作会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2299389, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250308_2105590.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2105049, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250306_2105049.htm", "content": "\n　　3月5日，市长陈岳峰先后深入市城发集团、市交发集团、福建一建集团、市投资集团调研，并主持召开座谈会，研究推动市属国企做强做优做大。副市长吴健成参加。\n　　座谈会上，陈岳峰充分肯定了市属国企在服务全市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250306_2105049.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.06 08:44:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研市属国有企业并主持召开座谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2298650, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250306_2105049.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2103873, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250301_2103873.htm", "content": "\n　　2月27日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开全市经济分析会议，贯彻落实省委省政府工作部署，分析研判当前经济运行情况，研究部署下阶段工作。市领导杨国昕、胡帅、廖金辉、吴健成参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，实现一季", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250301_2103873.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.01 10:39:00", "doctitle": "全市经济分析会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2297389, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250301_2103873.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2102076, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250223_2102076.htm", "content": "\n　　2月21日，市政府召开廉政工作会议，贯彻落实国务院、省政府廉政工作会议精神，对全市政府系统党风廉政建设和反腐败工作进行再部署、再推动。市政府党组书记、市长陈岳峰出席会议并讲话。市领导杨国昕、林菁、柳", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250223_2102076.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.23 13:12:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开廉政工作会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2295199, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250223_2102076.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2101228, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250219_2101228.htm", "content": "\n　　2月18日，全市宣传思想文化工作推进会召开。会议传达学习全国、全省宣传部长会议精神和市委工作要求，部署全市宣传思想文化工作。市委副书记杨兴忠出席会议并讲话，市领导吴健成主持。\n　　会议强调，要深入学习", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250219_2101228.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.19 08:43:00", "doctitle": "全市宣传思想文化工作推进会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2294220, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250219_2101228.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2100341, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250214_2100341.htm", "content": "\n　　2月13日，第十次三明市民政会议召开。会前，市委书记李春作出批示。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰出席并讲话，副市长吴健成主持。\n　　会议重温了习近平总书记关于三明民政工作的重要指示精神，进一步加深理解认识、感", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250214_2100341.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.14 08:47:00", "doctitle": "第十次三明市民政会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2293162, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250214_2100341.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2099671, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250211_2099671.htm", "content": "\n　　2月10日，市委书记李春、市长陈岳峰带队赴福州拜访部分省直部门，汇报对接有关事项，争取政策和项目资金支持。市领导杨国昕、郭海阳、胡帅、张元明、廖金辉、钟科、吴健成参加有关活动。\n　　李春、陈岳峰一行先", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250211_2099671.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.11 08:44:00", "doctitle": "市领导拜访省直有关部门", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2292462, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250211_2099671.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2095878, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250120_2095878.htm", "content": "\n　　1月19日，市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，贯彻落实省政府专题会议精神，研究部署下一阶段经济工作、春节前后稳工稳产及清理拖欠企业账款工作，确保实现一季度良好开局。市领导杨国昕、胡帅、张元明、柳建忠", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250120_2095878.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.20 09:05:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2288686, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "研究部署下一阶段经济工作及春节前后稳工稳产等工作", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250120_2095878.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2094707, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250115_2094707.htm", "content": "\n　　1月14日，全市老干部通报会召开，通报2024年全市组织、经济社会发展、党风廉政建设和反腐败工作情况。市委副书记杨兴忠主持会议，市委常委、组织部部长陈丽英，副市长吴健成出席会议。\n　　会议指出，过去一年，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250115_2094707.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.15 08:55:00", "doctitle": "全市老干部通报会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2286308, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250115_2094707.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2090560, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090560.htm", "content": "\n　　12月30日，市十四届人大常委会召开第二十二次会议。\n　　市人大常委会主任赖碧涛，副主任余建地、王立文、张知通、廖丽青，秘书长蔡金明及常委会其他组成人员出席会议。市政府副市长张元明，市法院院长陈枫，市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090560.htm", "docreltime": "2024.12.31 08:48:00", "doctitle": "市十四届人大常委会召开第二十二次会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2282435, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090560.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/", "rels": []}]}